  "50cd71a0-dd2d-423f-9109-923c8ca11540"],
 ".",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"2c9c9af4-d6d9-4a1c-b989-194d34a595fb"],

Cell["\<\
This is a particular Experimental construction in the Infra Fiber Bundles \
category. Its existing call forms remain available.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"237943c7-01b7-408b-b9fd-a8170cad56f1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A covector at ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " is a ray arriving at ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", the reversal of a ray leaving ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"90e48a7a-f62d-4053-8886-18137caf4496"],

Cell["\<\
The total graph is the tangent total graph with every ray reversed; only the \
projection differs.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6b5f3554-6e37-46c0-873f-483a92fc0cc6"]
}, Open  ]],

